---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="f10w-0x00"
  description="f10w-0x00 的个人博客与数字空间，记录学习、技术与日常的观察。"
  pageName="home"
  activeNav="home"
>
  <section class="home-section home-recent-posts" aria-labelledby="recent-posts-title" style="padding-top: clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px);">
    <div class="home-section-header">
      <h2 id="recent-posts-title">Recent Posts</h2>
      <a class="text-button" href="/blog/">Read All →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-post-grid">
      <article class="home-post-card">
        <a href="/blog/2026-10-01-how-i-use-obsidian/" class="home-post-card-link">
          <div class="home-post-cover">
            <img src="/_astro/814A9B04-173E-4FFE-AD5C-2A06884329B5-thumb.C1EMAMs5.avif" alt="我是怎么使用 Obsidian 的" width="640" height="320" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </div>
          <div class="home-post-body">
            <h3>我是怎么使用 Obsidian 的</h3>
            <p>Obsidian 的哲学和缺陷，双链笔记与本地知识库构建</p>
            <p class="post-meta home-post-meta">
              <time datetime="2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z">10月1日</time>
              <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
              <span>2994 字</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="home-post-card">
        <a href="/blog/2026-07-25-recommended-up-creators-im-following-part-3/" class="home-post-card-link">
          <div class="home-post-cover">
            <img src="/_astro/wp8667993-bilibili-wallpapers%201-thumb.RWTKrlzg.avif" alt="推荐几位我在看的 UP（三）" width="640" height="320" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </div>
          <div class="home-post-body">
            <h3>推荐几位我在看的 UP（三）</h3>
            <p>无关茉莉星、董晨宇、徐师傅、技术爬爬虾</p>
            <p class="post-meta home-post-meta">
              <time datetime="2026-07-25T00:00:00.000Z">7月25日</time>
              <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
              <span>1860 字</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="home-post-card">
        <a href="/blog/2026-07-20-my-wisdom-tooth-extraction-experience/" class="home-post-card-link">
          <div class="home-post-cover">
            <img src="/_astro/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2020_%202026_%2005_29_43%20PM-thumb.DmWba74d.avif" alt="拔智齿的经历" width="640" height="320" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </div>
          <div class="home-post-body">
            <h3>拔智齿的经历</h3>
            <p>拔智齿的全过程记录：拍片、付费、麻醉、手术，以及术后一周的恢复经验</p>
            <p class="post-meta home-post-meta">
              <time datetime="2026-07-20T00:00:00.000Z">7月20日</time>
              <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
              <span>3240 字</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="home-post-card">
        <a href="/blog/2026-06-10-visual-and-interaction-design-of-this-blog-site/" class="home-post-card-link">
          <div class="home-post-cover">
            <img src="/_astro/3C00CB1E-3C8A-48A9-9FE2-BE12F01B7E87-thumb.CigA-ns2.avif" alt="本博客站的视觉和交互设计" width="640" height="320" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </div>
          <div class="home-post-body">
            <h3>本博客站的视觉和交互设计</h3>
            <p>对博客站的设计思路的记录，也是对参与博客站建设的人的致谢</p>
            <p class="post-meta home-post-meta">
              <time datetime="2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z">6月10日</time>
              <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
              <span>3659 字</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
